# Documentation (canonical docs)

**Policy:** `docs/domains/documentation/standards.md`  
**Procedure:** `.cursor/skills/canonical-docs/SKILL.md` (Mode A / Mode B)

- Behaviour-changing PRs update the canonical feature doc in the **same PR** via `/canonical-docs sync`.
- Decision logs live **inside** the canonical doc (append-only).
- `changes/` holds proposals and in-delivery work only; delete when **fully** delivered (deletion guard in the skill).
- `.agents/memory/` is for agent **lessons only** — product rules live in the canonical doc, not in memory.
- Do not copy the sync steps here — use the skill and standards.
